                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Food I ate while studying at Yangming #8 So far: Basil pork, green curry, and coconut rice (=red curry) – all were so delicious!!! The red curry had so much meat, I almost couldn\u0027t finish it.\n\nWhile eating, the proprietress suddenly called me over to help her write some calligraphy, and I happily stuck it on, then picked up a bowl and asked me to take a picture of it for her~~ So cute, hahaha!\n\nAnyway, these are my three favorite Thai dishes in Shipai: Thai Soup Lily, Thai Yuan, and Soup Thai Thai. Being surrounded by delicious Thai food is so wonderful!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "記錄在陽明念書吃過的食物 #8\n目前吃過：打拋豬、綠咖哩、椰汁飯（=紅咖哩），全部都有夠好吃！！！紅咖哩那個肉實在有夠多，我真的差點吃不完\n\n吃一吃突然被老闆娘叫去幫忙寫字，然後就很滿意地貼起來，拿起一個碗讓我幫她拍照～～ 怎麼這麼可愛啦哈哈哈\n\nanyway 這是我心目中的石牌三大泰式：泰順莉、泰圓、湯泰泰。被好吃的泰式料理包圍，真是太幸福了！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
