                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The green curry was amazing, spicy and appetizing! The meat was perfectly tender, not dry at all. The biggest surprise was the poached egg—it was perfectly runny and soft-boiled! I absolutely loved it 🍛✨\n\nThe menu has been updated recently too! 😋🍳",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "​綠咖哩味道超棒，辛香開胃！裡面的肉質處理得很嫩，完全不乾柴。最驚喜的是荷包蛋，切開竟然是半熟糖心的！真的超級喜歡 🍛✨\n​菜單最近也有更新喔！😋🍳",
